Disk-aware KV reclaim bootstrap addition (ALREADY APPLIED to
gds-control/bootstrap/sitecustomize.py by the root integration step;
kept as the artifact of record for the six-line addition).

Adds the serving-adapter bootstrap to the loader sitecustomize so the
LMCache disk backing + native/BPF victim-policy binding activates when
LMCACHE_KV_RECLAIM is set (see lmcache_kv_reclaim_adapter.py).

Verify ownership on a copy (must succeed with -R, must report
"previously applied" forward):

    patch -p1 -R --dry-run < gds-control-bootstrap-sitecustomize.patch

Sitecustomize import path: same requirement as the existing bootstrap
modules - gds-control/ must be on sys.path when the import runs; the
kv_reclaim adapter adds no new path requirement.

--- a/bootstrap/sitecustomize.py
+++ b/bootstrap/sitecustomize.py
@@ -8,3 +8,9 @@
 from lmcache_gds_async_prefetch_adapter import bootstrap_from_env as bootstrap_async
 
 bootstrap_async()
+
+from lmcache_kv_reclaim_adapter import (
+    bootstrap_from_env as bootstrap_kv_reclaim,
+)
+
+bootstrap_kv_reclaim()
